# Root build context (Prod Image Build in CI, Build and Publish: context ".",
# file services/<svc>/Dockerfile). The prod stages copy only shared/infra and
# services/<svc>; this keeps the rest out of the context sent to the builder.
# Owner decision 2026-11-04 (ADR-0014 amendment).
#
# Patterns are relative to the repo root: "web/" is the sales website only,
# never services/admin-console/web/ (the console's own pages, which its image
# needs). Per-service .dockerignore files apply to the compose (service
# directory) builds and are unchanged.

# The sales website (Vercel builds it, no image does).
web/

# Node and Next.js output anywhere.
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
